HoldFast 执迷 — License (v1.0)

This repository combines original work with material derived from
MalruleLib. Different components carry different terms; all of them are
non-commercial. This file formalizes the terms already stated in
README.md ("License notes") and the ModelScope model card.

1. MalruleLib-derived material — data/ (scaffolds, rendered dialogues,
   probe sets, DPO pairs), the generator/probe code that embeds MalruleLib
   malrule logic (e.g. harness/gen_scaffolds.py, harness/build_probes.py,
   harness/probe_eval.py), and runs_mirror/ evaluation outputs — inherits
   the MalruleLib license (non-commercial, share-alike, attribution):
   https://github.com/sonkar-lab/malrulelib (pinned commit 8ddedfb).
   Attribution: Chen, Liu & Sonkar, arXiv:2601.03217 (ACL Main 2026).

2. All other original content in this repository (the remaining harness/
   code, docs/, figures) is released for non-commercial research use with
   attribution: cite this repository (BibTeX in README.md).

3. Trained checkpoints (hosted on ModelScope at
   ZhaoKevin/holdfast-qwen3-student-simulators) are released for
   non-commercial research use with attribution. Qwen3 base weights are
   Apache-2.0; respect both licenses.

4. Carried restriction (from the MalruleLib license): MalruleLib-derived
   content must not be used to train, fine-tune, or evaluate commercial
   or closed-source models. This restriction carries to downstream use of
   the released data and of checkpoints trained on it.

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The released simulators
deliberately produce mathematically incorrect content by design; see the
intended-use notes in README.md and the model card.
